WEBVTT

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.850
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.060
One day, I was dragged to the Digital World

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.910
along with Akari and Zenjirou.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.530
We went on to travel through several Zones,

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.890
gaining new companions

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
<b>Team ?       Team Kiriha                          Team Taiki</b>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
Mysterious                        Rival
Girl

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
<b>Enemy?
Ally</b>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.960
Protagonist

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.760
and collecting Code Crowns.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.970
<b>Big Adventure in the Sand Zone Ruins!</b>

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.730
Big Adventure in the Sand Zone Ruins!

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.080
What's that?

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:33.690
I don't know...

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.970
It's huge!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.310
It looks like an island.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.460
That's the Lake Zone we just came from.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.220
Huh?

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.530
You're right! I see the castle!

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:46.690
And the aurora!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.180
Long ago...

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.880
When the Digital World collapsed,

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:56.250
the fragments of the Code Crown 
created many different Zones.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:13.160
What happened?

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.160
Humans like you came and...

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.570
Never mind. I won't say it.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:22.260
Hey, Jijimon... Your head...

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.090
Uh oh!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.790
Normal Digimon can't maintain 
their physical forms

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.700
for long in the Digital realm.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.310
So that's why you stay in the Xros Loader?

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.780
Exactly.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.050
It's the exit!

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:44.480
I wonder what this Zone is called?

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.000
This is the Sand Zone.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.670
It once prospered as an 
area rich in gemstones.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.180
It was known as the City of Gold.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:53.960
This place?

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.510
Yes. The land eventually fell 
to ruin for some reason,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.570
but it's said that the treasure from 
its golden days still lies here.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:04.990
Yay! Then let's look for 
the treasure, Brother!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.110
Yeah! That sounds like fun!

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.550
Yeah! A treasure hunt is 
a man's idea of maroons!

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:10.990
I mean, romance!

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.870
If you say stuff like that,

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.320
we're gonna get wrapped up 
in something weird again.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.660
Water...

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.350
Dying...

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.530
I can't go on!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.300
Why did we end up in this mess?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.100
Because Jijimon had to go and say all that!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.600
Look at that!

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.610
An oasis!

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:42.370
It's not a mirage?

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.470
Only one way to find out!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.340
Shoutmon, there's water!

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:45.990
What?!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.950
Water!

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.420
Water! Water! Water! Water!

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.350
Water!

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.950
Shoutmon, wait for us!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.930
I'm telling you, it might be a mirage!

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:59.710
This happens every time! I've had it!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.830
He disappeared!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.100
Brother!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.530
It can't be!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.070
What?!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.220
It's an ant lion's pit!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.790
These things always happen to us!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.210
I'm no ant lion.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:25.550
I am Lord Scorpiomon of the Bagra Army!

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.590
The Bagra Army?!

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.520
Taiki! We've gotta DigiXros!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.380
I know, but when we're stuck like this...

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.360
We can't do a thing, can we?

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:38.980
Just keep quiet and let these 
pincers take care of you.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.130
Dorulumon! Use Drill Blader!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.800
What? Here?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.240
Yes! We'll dive into the sand to evade him!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.440
All right!

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.970
Drill Blader!

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.210
What?!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.450
Lord Blastmon!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.960
The ever-radiant Lord Blastmon!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:08.810
The strongest of the Three 
Head Officers, Lord Blastmon!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.060
Dinner is served!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.760
Just call me and I'm there!

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.620
Blablablabla...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.910
Blastmon's the name!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:33.190
Diamonds are the best for improving 
my shine, but these will do.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.010
Shine!

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.140
Not bad.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:43.720
But rumor has it the treasure lying 
in this Zone is the ultimate diamond.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.150
Indeed!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.240
And just who are you?

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.040
The kids with the red Xros Loader!

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.340
The red!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.210
What?!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.420
You're Blastmon!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.610
Blastmon?

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.000
One of the Bagra Army's Three Head Officers.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.620
Once he starts raving over his gems,

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.600
there's no stopping him!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.520
Sand is falling on my luminous body...

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:12.770
Hold it right there!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:13.500
Run!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.260
You won't get away!

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.470
Scorpiomon.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.900
Th-That voice...

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:28.310
Lord Blastmon! Forgive me!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:29.610
Evilmon.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.590
Yes, sir! We'll pursue them right away!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:32.640
Not that.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.800
Get this filth off of me, quickly!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.620
That's what you wanted?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.500
I can't tell where the exit is!

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:45.270
Wow! Crystals!

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.880
You weren't even interested 
in the treasure hunt...

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.290
But these could be useful 
for repairing Ballistamon.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.970
Brother! They're coming!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.050
Halt!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.550
This is as far as you go, brats.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.960
We're in trouble now, Brother!

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.720
What do we do, Taiki Kudou?!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.850
Taiki!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.540
We've gotta go for it, General!

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:24.400
Get in!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.960
Who was that?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.500
Let's go!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.610
After them!

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.250
Who are you?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:53.440
Me? I'm a world traveling 
treasure hunter, Revolmon.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:55.390
They're following us!

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.300
The track stops! This is the end!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.890
Do something, Taiki!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:08.730
Wanna stop?

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.100
What do you think?!

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:11.740
No! Pick up speed!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.960
What?!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:25.780
It's a river!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:27.230
We did it, Brother!

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.770
We're alive!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.680
That's my General.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.870
Way to go, Taiki!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.370
Yeah!

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.460
You knew the river was here?

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.460
Yeah.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.430
I thought I smelled water.

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:43.140
Wow, you're good!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.970
They fell over the edge.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:52.520
But there's water below. 
Let's go down to search.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.810
Roger!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.390
They're gone.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:02.160
Revolmon...

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.750
Thanks. You saved us.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.700
No need to thank me.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.440
Haven't you heard of "give and take"?

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:17.000
I saved you, so now you can 
help me find the treasure.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.450
Why do we have to help you?!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.870
We help each other out in times of need.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.520
Besides, I already know 
where the treasure is.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.590
What?!

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:28.650
Why didn't you say so?!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.970
This is it.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:34.120
It looks like there's something 
beyond this door,

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.360
but it won't open.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:38.220
It's probably sealed.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.310
So if we break the seal...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.430
Okay!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.450
Rowdy Ro—

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:45.440
Don't attack it!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.600
What are you doing?!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:52.210
Doors like this are often rigged 
with traps to repel attackers.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.550
Leave this to me.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.210
Jijimon?

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.410
Door, feel my gentle breeze!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.930
Stinky!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.860
What's gentle about that?!

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:09.050
Then I'll just have to 
use my feminine wiles.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.300
Mr. Door, please open!

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.300
It opened?!

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.600
I have to inform Lord Blastmon!

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:25.200
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.650
They may be made up of data,

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:32.550
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.620
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:38.190
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.260
DigiXros!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.240
Oops.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.950
What are you doing?

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.400
Oh, don't mind me. Go on ahead.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.730
Uh, okay...

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.270
Huh?

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.280
A dead end...

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.360
No, I think it's a big door.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.270
What's the deal here?

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.860
Run!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:36.090
Taiki! Do something!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.740
We'll be crushed!

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.040
It's a one-way path with no escape!

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:41.630
I'm so tired of this!

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.500
Well, what will you do now,

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.050
General Taiki?

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.320
Brother! Up ahead!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:51.460
Halt!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.760
The Bagra Army!

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:53.690
Taiki!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.670
That's it! Shoutmon, 
make a niche in the wall!

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:58.570
Leave it to me!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.870
Rowdy Rocker!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:02.930
Was that them?!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.540
Everyone get in!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.110
What's that noise?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:21.070
Raise my fist, and bam!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.410
This should be the last obstacle.

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.370
Wow, what an incredible place.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.990
It's so high, I can't see the bottom.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.490
I can't take it! I'm gonna die! 
I'm scared of heights!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.580
Get used to it, Brother!

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.730
Shoutmon, look at these.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.560
The DigiMemories!

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.820
They're all back to normal?

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:56.630
Yeah. I checked them earlier,

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.220
and they were all back.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.280
Awesome!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.160
DigiMemories, eh? That's quite a treasure.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:04.500
Revolmon...

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.380
After you use a DigiMemory once,

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.170
it turns black and you 
can't use it again, right?

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.220
Yes, that's what I've heard.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.260
But it's only temporary.

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:15.050
It seems you can use them 
again when you switch Zones.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:16.020
I get it...

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.550
What's wrong, Dorulumon?

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.280
Sounds like they've caught up to us.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.800
Hurry! They're coming!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.400
There they are!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.700
What? Where?!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.360
He's fast!

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.930
Found you!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:34.340
Now I'm in the lead!

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.730
The treasure is mine for the taking!

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:38.680
Huh?

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:39.730
What's going on?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.170
Lord Blastmon! In front of you!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.880
What's happening?!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.320
What's he doing?

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:56.780
I told you.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.010
Once he starts raving over his gems,

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:00.640
there's no stopping him.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.920
I get it.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.170
He was right.

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.760
How dare you! Attack all at once!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.530
<b>HolyAngemon</b>

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.530
<b>Heaven's Gate</b>

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.160
DigiMemory!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.620
HolyAngemon!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.600
Heaven's Gate, activate!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:24.330
Heaven's Gate!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.860
What's that?!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.470
Help!

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:37.610
Wow!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.090
Looks like Heaven's Gate sends enemies

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.910
through that gate to some other place.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.360
It turned black.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.830
Now we can't use HolyAngemon 
again in this Zone.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.880
Right, Revolmon?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:51.710
Revolmon?

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:54.550
I wouldn't move if I were you.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.910
That little cutie up there could get hurt.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.300
You're going to fight the 
king of this area now.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.680
If you beat him, I'll get the treasure.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:04.800
King?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.480
How do you know that?

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.740
Look at the cliff that Bagra 
Army guy just busted up.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.010
That's a hidden switch

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.260
that opens the path to 
King Pharaohmon's chamber.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.790
Pharaohmon's chamber?

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.060
It's already activated.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:28.690
Is this...

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.140
What's going on?

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.170
I'm scared of heights... 
I'm scared of heights...

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.990
We're not up high anymore, Brother.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:35.470
Huh?

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.220
Hey, where are we?

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.420
Will you get off me now?

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.000
I am Pharaohmon.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.340
Do you intend to bring 
darkness to this world,

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.810
or will you bring light?

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.730
What? Darkness or light?

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.430
Who cares about that?

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.320
Be quiet.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:54.770
Light!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.160
Prove it.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.400
You two, take Cutemon and get away!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.290
Dorulumon?

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:09.280
Gotcha!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.090
What is that?!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.660
Y-You...

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.080
Sparrowmon is strong!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.130
Yes.

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.070
Miss Nene!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.770
Fire Shot!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.360
M-Miss Nene!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.490
You're a human, too?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.500
What are you doing here?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.830
Nene!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.020
Nene, I can destroy them, right?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:06.120
Go as wild as you like.

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:10.070
Oh? A black Xros Loader?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.310
Prove it.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.400
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.580
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.490
Right!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.780
Shoutmon!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.360
Okay!

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.660
Ballistamon!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.290
Dorulumon!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:32.730
Starmons!

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.280
DigiXros!

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:40.100
DigiXros!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:44.750
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:51.720
Pharaohmon, this is our power.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:55.050
It's DigiXros, the power that 
will bring light to the world!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.140
Prove it.

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:58.960
Here I go, Taiki!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:06.860
What's going on?

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.330
His attacks aren't working?

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.500
No way!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:11.120
Use Burning Star Crusher!

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.250
X4!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.480
It's not working! What do we do?

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.050
How can we win?

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.580
<i>You're going to fight the 
king of this area now.</i>

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.600
<i>If you beat him, I'll get the treasure.</i>

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:35.810
<i>You're going to fight...</i>

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:36.690
<i>You're going to fight...</i>

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.380
<i>You're going to fight...</i>

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.860
I've got it!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:43.170
We can't fight him!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:45.750
Stop attacking him, X4!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:46.550
What?

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.720
What did you say?!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:51.550
Fight him! If you don't beat 
him, the treasure won't...

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.750
That's enough, Revolmon.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:57.360
And Pharaohmon, this is a test, isn't it?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.870
You were testing us, weren't you?

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:03.090
You were never trying to defeat us.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.290
Right?

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.090
You've figured it out.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.310
We don't fight those who aren't evil.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.140
That's what you meant when you told us to

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:16.250
prove our power of the light.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.220
And Revolmon, I saw right through your lie.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.040
You two are friends, aren't you?

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.560
Bingo!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.760
Take these.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.410
DigiMemories, and the 
Sand Zone's Code Crown.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.670
Thanks!

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:34.520
Awesome! Now we've got nine DigiMemories!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.900
Way to go, Taiki!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:36.390
Yeah!

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:37.760
I saw that.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.270
Clearly.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:42.530
Miss Nene! I'm receiving an image!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:46.670
Oh, Taiki got the Sand Zone treasure.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:47.840
Wow.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.060
Lord Blastmon!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.020
Bad news! The Code Crown has been...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.820
What?!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.120
The treasure in this land wasn't a diamond?!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.590
Again, that's what you wanted?

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:14.870
Then I'll just crush the 
red and black teams myself

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.230
and steal the Code Crown!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.330
What?!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:22.330
It's the blue team!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:24.180
Are the kid with the black Xros Loader

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:27.690
and the kid with the blue 
Xros Loader working together?

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.940
I'll destroy red, black, and blue!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.080
Go, Cyberdramon.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.050
It's embracing me...

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:42.720
Don't tell me you love me?!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.360
What's happening?

00:20:57.740 --> 00:20:59.600
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.840
<b>Monitamon's Lovely♥ Enemy Search</b>

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.920
Searching for enemy data.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.760
Revolmon.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:07.740
Attacks include Justice Bullet, in 
which he fires a bullet of justice.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:11.580
<b>[Type]

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:11.580
<b>Mutant Type</b>

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Justice Bullet</b>

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.720
It's hard to see the expression on his face.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.670
Let's draw a face on him while he's sleeping!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.650
As in eyes, nose, and mouth?!

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.420
Taiki's been swallowed up

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.160
by the desert along with 
the assassin, Baalmon!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.890
I never knew Baalmon had such a secret...

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:22.790
I will defeat Taiki!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.710
Shoutmon and the others are attacking me!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.130
What should I do?!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:27.530
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:29.330
<b>Taiki, Warrior of the Goddess!</b>

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.400
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
